{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25830","headline":"新楼诗二十首 水寺 · 李绅","name":"新楼诗二十首 水寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟波野寺经过处，水国苍茫梦想中。\n云散浦间江月迥，日曛洲渚海潮通。\n坐看鱼鸟沈浮远，静见楼台上下同。\n闻道化城方便喻，只应从此到龙宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25830.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25830","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}